  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "<p>Refreshed <strong>September 26, 2026</strong> from Cars.com (25 total, 11 post-filter), CarGurus (76 total, 10 post-filter), and AutoTrader (37 total, 18 post-filter). TrueCar skipped (body-style filter broken). Excluded 2-seat roadsters: Saturn Sky, Mercedes SLK/SLC/SL, Lexus SC 430, Cadillac Allante, Ford Thunderbird. Excluded personal deny-list: MINI, Buick, Volvo, Toyota Solara, Chevrolet Camaro, Ford Mustang &lt;2005. All 10 picks have images and verified 4-seat body. No manuals confirmed this refresh — see Manual Top 10 tab.</p>",
    "picks": [
      {
        "rank": 1,
        "year": 2016,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A3",
        "trim": "2.0T Premium Cabriolet",
        "price": 12500,
        "mileage": 84000,
        "location": "Springfield, PA",
        "distanceMi": 4,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/780193901",
        "dealer": "Private Seller Exchange",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://assets.cai-media-management.com/ps-vehicle-media/81ec9b8f-0542-4349-a1ea-1486c391b6c5.JPG",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "whyGood": "Only 4 miles from Media — the closest car in the whole batch. 2016 A3 Cabriolet is the most current car on the list; Audi's 2.0T with DSG is well-proven by this vintage. 84k miles is well within the A3's stride. Private-seller pricing keeps it honest at $12,500. Soft top on the A3 Cabriolet is notably reliable compared to the Eos.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full soft-top open/close cycle (listen for motor strain, check rear window delamination), roof drain channels (front A-pillar drains clog and drip on feet), DSG fluid age (should be <40k mi since last change), check for DSG shudder at low speed, inspect rear wheel arches for rust bubbling.",
        "bottomLine": "Best combination of recency, proximity, and price — see it first."
      },
      {
        "rank": 2,
        "year": 2013,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "328i",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 11995,
        "mileage": 54137,
        "location": "Feasterville Trevose, PA",
        "distanceMi": 27,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/791764986",
        "dealer": "Divan Auto Group",
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/10a8125f1ef04c5cb92914cd6f16ad45.jpg",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "whyGood": "Only 54k miles on a 13-year-old BMW convertible is exceptional — this was clearly a garage queen or second car. Great Deal rating confirms it's priced below market. N20 2.0T turbo inline-4 is adequate for fun use; at 54k it's barely broken in.",
        "whatToVerify": "N20 timing chain tensioner (critical — budget $800-1200 as preventive if not done; noisy on cold start = worn), oil consumption test, soft-top complete cycle, headliner/rear-seat water staining indicating past leak.",
        "bottomLine": "Best mileage-per-dollar in the batch — get a BMW specialist PPI before committing."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
        "year": 2008,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "135i",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 11995,
        "mileage": 48371,
        "location": "Turnersville, NJ",
        "distanceMi": 22,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/790118095",
        "dealer": "Premier Auto Group",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/48e6e5f8e26f4c9ab27d9520494927ca.jpg",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "whyGood": "Under 50k miles on a 17-year-old car — this 135i was clearly a pampered weekend toy. BMW's N54 twin-turbo inline-6 makes 300hp and is the same basic engine as the iconic 335i. The 1-series convertible is small and agile, a true driver's car.",
        "whatToVerify": "High-pressure fuel pump (HPFP) — check for hard-start on hot engine; wastegate rattle at cold idle; injector health; rear-window seal and glass delamination; top condition including rear fold mechanism.",
        "bottomLine": "Probably the most fun car on this list — if HPFP checks out, it's a buy."
      },
      {
        "rank": 4,
        "year": 2009,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "335i",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 9999,
        "mileage": 94595,
        "location": "Norristown, PA",
        "distanceMi": 15,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/788977524",
        "dealer": "CarVision of Trooper",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/68290259c1614edcb118b4d377b55912.jpg",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "whyGood": "N54 twin-turbo 3.0L inline-6 (300hp) in a 3-series convertible with proper rear seats. Only 15 miles from Media. Under $10k for a 335i convertible is rare. 94k miles is reasonable for a BMW if maintained.",
        "whatToVerify": "HPFP (same N54 concerns as 135i above), wastegate rattle, injectors, turbo actuator, oil leaks from valve cover and oil filter housing, soft-top full cycle and seals.",
        "bottomLine": "Twin-turbo power at sedan-like price, closest BMW on the list — solid pick."
      },
