        "dealer": null,
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/08/19/05/26/2020_ford_mustang-pic-7479190532907237465-1024x768.jpeg",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "whyGood": "A 2020 Mustang for $11,485 is remarkable — only 6 years old. The S550 Mustang convertible is a comfortable, modern drop-top with good tech and real back seats. Great Deal rating. EcoBoost 2.3L is proven reliable by 2020 vintage and gets better MPG than V8.",
        "whatToVerify": "Cam phaser noise (updated by 2020 but ask for service history), rear seat water staining (top leak test), all SYNC features, rear camera function, 10-speed auto shift quality.",
        "bottomLine": "Most modern car on the list — high miles on a 2020 are less scary than high miles on a 2008."
