        "dealer": "Faulkner INFINITI of Willow Grove",
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/4b72fbbab2b643faa7bbbf9610afad8a.jpg",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "whyGood": "The VQ37VHR naturally-aspirated 330hp V6 is one of the most bulletproof sports-car engines ever built — known to go 200k+ with basic maintenance. G37 convertible is distinctive, sporty, and the Great Deal rating confirms market value. At an INFINITI dealer for credibility.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full soft-top open/close cycle (the G37 top is complex with 5 latches — test every step slowly), rear window seal at corners, check secondary O2 sensor codes (common/cheap fix), brake and coolant fluid age.",
        "bottomLine": "Most reliable engine in the batch — buy with confidence if the top cycles clean."
