        "year": 2006,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "325",
        "trim": "Ci Convertible",
        "price": 12950,
        "mileage": 57240,
        "location": null,
        "distanceMi": null,
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/1034a46d-fbd1-4d10-b068-5aee61ff7add/",
        "dealer": "Car Cheer",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/in/v2/a733be78-f490-4868-adbe-201a3d056e0c/2a77df0a-c859-4cdf-a54b-eced82338798/4l-TsV5eUhHI3jizwryJoAH6LXg.jpg",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "whyGood": "E46 325Ci with under 60k miles — this is the last of the analog BMWs and the enthusiast's choice for pure driving feel. The E46 is well-documented, cheap to maintain, and parts are everywhere. Clean title and no accidents from Cars.com filter.",
        "whatToVerify": "Coolant system (replace all plastic flanges preventively ~$300), VANOS rattle on cold start, soft-top hydraulic rams (common leak point), rear wheel arch rust inspection, coolant expansion tank condition.",
        "bottomLine": "Enthusiast's pick for pure analog driving — if the coolant system is sorted, it's a joy."
      },
      {
        "rank": 8,
        "year": 2010,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "S5",
        "trim": "Premium Plus Cabriolet",
        "price": 9990,
        "mileage": 92034,
        "location": "Feasterville Trevose, PA",
        "distanceMi": 27,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/792013039",
        "dealer": "Divan Auto Group",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/7426212c8bad4d00968646881da60074.jpg",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "whyGood": "S5 Cabriolet is the most beautiful car in this batch. Supercharged 3.0L V6 with quattro AWD gives all-weather capability and 333hp. $9,990 for an S5 Cabriolet is buying at wholesale.",
        "whatToVerify": "Supercharger nose cone inspection (listen for whine), timing chain service (2010 Audi 3.0T chains stretch around 80k), MMI system function, roof drains (front corners clog → wet trunk), trunk seal, all quattro lights on dash.",
        "bottomLine": "Best-looking car in the batch — if the body is clean and roof seals hold, it's special."
      },
      {
        "rank": 9,
        "year": 2017,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "4 Series",
        "trim": "430i xDrive Convertible AWD",
        "price": 13995,
        "mileage": 112184,
        "location": "Birdsboro, PA",
