        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/09/06/11/02/2017_bmw_4_series-pic-3273686523163104197-1024x768.jpeg",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "whyGood": "The newest BMW convertible in the batch — 2017 F33 430i xDrive with all-wheel drive. Good Deal rating. The B46 2.0T in the 430i is more refined than the N20; AWD gives real all-season utility. $13,995 for a 2017 BMW convertible is solid value.",
